12. Example: Customer support

Suppose your company receives:

10 million support tickets

A user asks:

> "My Azure VM suddenly stopped working."



You could retrieve historical tickets with similar meaning:

"VM became unavailable"
"Virtual machine won't start"
"Compute instance failed"
