30. Embeddings and code

Embeddings aren't limited to natural language.

You can represent:

Java code
Python code
SQL
Terraform
Kubernetes YAML

Then search semantically.

For example:

> "Find functions that authenticate with AWS."



could retrieve code containing:

boto3.client(...)

even if the exact phrase "authenticate with AWS" isn't present.

This can support:

code search
duplicate detection
repository exploration
bug similarity
security analysis


